WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Clear a circle of grass and weeds where the young tree will grow.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Dig wider than the root ball, and about as deep. Keep the dark topsoil separate.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Fill the hole with water. If water still stands the next day, plant on a raised mound.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Set the top of the root ball level with the ground. Keep the graft union well above it.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Firm the soil gently. Make a shallow basin and keep the mulch away from the trunk.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Give the new tree a deep soak so water reaches the roots.
